      "writtenOn": "2021-06-27T19:52:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "OpenSSH continues to signal that they intend to remove RSA SHA-1 support in their release notes: https://www.openssh.com/releasenotes.html\n\nThey also note: \"This algorithm is unfortunately still used widely despite the existence of better alternatives\" It\u0027d be unfortunate if Go was contributing to a situation where bad crypto couldn\u0027t be removed because otherwise excellent SSH implementations don\u0027t support better options.",
      "revId": "529275081d22a0282b1c5ccd137ffab21180d419",
      "serverId": "62eb7196-b449-3ce5-99f1-c037f21e1705"
    },
    {
