      "writtenOn": "2021-08-23T17:32:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Since t.hostKeys is switched to a map the ordering will now be randomized, meaning the order in which supported key algorithms is advertised will also be randomized, which is probably not what we want?\n\nhostKeys should probably just be switched to a slice of structs which contain the Signer and it\u0027s alg type (or just take the extra steps and extra the alg with `PublicKey().Type()`).",
      "revId": "529275081d22a0282b1c5ccd137ffab21180d419",
      "serverId": "62eb7196-b449-3ce5-99f1-c037f21e1705"
    },
